\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 You are a senior game architect, gameplay programmer, technical product designer, and AI-assisted development specialist.\
I want to build a reusable 
\f1\b Casual Game Factory
\f0\b0  for rapidly creating and publishing mobile games in the style of successful solitaire/adventure/puzzle games.\
The goal is to create a reusable technical and content framework that allows me to launch approximately 
\f1\b one new game per month
\f0\b0 , while changing the game's visual identity, theme, content, and selected gameplay mechanics.\
The framework must maximize reuse while making each individual game feel like a distinct original product.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

